  "goodToKnow": "Foltern is a regular verb for torturing: Er wurde gefoltert. The noun is die Folter, and torture is banned in Germany: Article 104 of the Grundgesetz forbids mistreating detained persons, and Article 1 protects human dignity. Figuratively it's lighter: Das Warten foltert mich. Die Foltermethoden are torture methods. A related, milder verb is quälen (to torment)."
